{"seq":2,"slug":"biological-networks","title":"生物网络（Biological Networks）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/network-science-complex-systems/applications/biological-networks","wordCount":1854,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"生物网络-biological-networks\">生物网络（Biological Networks）</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>蛋白质交互网络</strong>：无标度、模块化，hub 蛋白多为必需基因——&quot;鲁棒而脆弱&quot;的生物版本</li>\n<li><strong>代谢网络蝴蝶结结构</strong>：扇入（营养输入）→ 核心代谢 → 扇出（生物合成），提供灵活性与鲁棒性</li>\n<li><strong>基因调控网络基序</strong>：前馈环等过表达基序实现时间过滤等信号处理功能</li>\n<li><strong>网络医学</strong>：疾病是交互网络中功能模块的扰动，网络邻近度方法用于药物重定位</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"生物学的网络视角\">生物学的网络视角</h2><p>生物系统从分子到生态尺度都组织为网络。基因不孤立运作，而是通过调控网络协调表达；蛋白质不孤立折叠，而是通过交互网络执行功能；物种不孤立生存，而是通过食物网相互依赖。网络视角的核心价值在于：理解任何单一组件都不够——必须理解组件之间的关系。</p>\n<p>生物网络的层次体系：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>网络类型</th>\n<th>节点</th>\n<th>边</th>\n<th>典型规模</th>\n<th>关键性质</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基因调控网络</td>\n<td>基因/转录因子</td>\n<td>调控关系</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 节点</td>\n<td>有向、层级结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蛋白质-蛋白质交互</td>\n<td>蛋白质</td>\n<td>物理结合</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 节点</td>\n<td>无标度、模块化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代谢网络</td>\n<td>代谢物</td>\n<td>酶催化反应</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 代谢物</td>\n<td>蝴蝶结结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信号转导网络</td>\n<td>分子</td>\n<td>信号传递</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>级联、反馈环</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>神经网络</td>\n<td>神经元</td>\n<td>突触连接</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>11</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{11}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">11</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>小世界、层次模块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>食物网</td>\n<td>物种</td>\n<td>捕食关系</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>1</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>有向无环、营养级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"蛋白质交互网络-interactome\">蛋白质交互网络（Interactome）</h2><p>蛋白质-蛋白质交互（PPI）网络——细胞的&quot;社交网络&quot;——是网络生物学的旗舰对象。酵母双杂交实验和亲和纯化质谱（AP-MS）已绘制出多个物种的 interactome 草图。</p>\n<p>关键拓扑特征：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>无标度</strong>：度分布重尾（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma \\approx 2.1-2.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6776em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.4</span></span></span></span></span>），存在高度连接的 hub 蛋白</li>\n<li><strong>模块化</strong>：蛋白质聚成功能模块——参与同一生物过程的蛋白质倾向于彼此交互</li>\n<li><strong>核心-边缘结构</strong>：高度保守的核心模块 + 快速演化的边缘蛋白</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Hub 蛋白的生物学意义</strong>：PPI 网络中的 hub 蛋白（如 p53、Ras）往往是&quot;必需基因&quot;（essential gene）——敲除致死。这与无标度网络的&quot;鲁棒而脆弱&quot;二象性一致：随机突变（随机节点删除）通常无害，但打击 hub 基因（蓄意攻击）则致死。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 蛋白质交互网络分析管道&#10;        A[实验数据: Y2H / AP-MS] --&gt; B[构建交互图]&#10;        B --&gt; C[拓扑分析: 度分布, 聚集, 模块]&#10;        C --&gt; D[功能预测: 未知蛋白的功能注释]&#10;        D --&gt; E[疾病基因预测: 候选致病基因]&#10;        E --&gt; F[药物靶点: 网络药理学]&#10;    end&#10;    B --&gt; G[质量评估: 假阳性过滤]&#10;    G --&gt; C\">graph TD\n    subgraph 蛋白质交互网络分析管道\n        A[实验数据: Y2H / AP-MS] --&gt; B[构建交互图]\n        B --&gt; C[拓扑分析: 度分布, 聚集, 模块]\n        C --&gt; D[功能预测: 未知蛋白的功能注释]\n        D --&gt; E[疾病基因预测: 候选致病基因]\n        E --&gt; F[药物靶点: 网络药理学]\n    end\n    B --&gt; G[质量评估: 假阳性过滤]\n    G --&gt; C</pre><h2 id=\"代谢网络\">代谢网络</h2><p>代谢网络将代谢物（节点）通过酶催化反应（有向边）连接。全基因组代谢重建（如 E. coli 的 iJO1366 模型）包含上千个反应。</p>\n<p><strong>蝴蝶结结构</strong>：代谢网络的全局架构呈蝴蝶结（bow-tie）形状：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>扇入（Fan-in）：营养物质输入路径</li>\n<li>巨连通核心（Giant Strong Component）：核心代谢（TCA 循环、糖酵解等），代谢物在此高度互联</li>\n<li>扇出（Fan-out）：生物合成输出路径</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这种结构提供了模块化和鲁棒性：核心代谢高度互联保证了代谢灵活性（多条替代路径），输入/输出扇区的模块化允许独立适应不同环境。</p>\n<p><strong>约束优化与 FBA</strong>：通量平衡分析（Flux Balance Analysis）将代谢网络建模为线性规划问题——在化学计量矩阵的约束下最大化生物质产量。网络拓扑决定了约束空间的维度和可行域的形状。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基因调控网络\">基因调控网络</h2><p>基因调控网络（GRN）描述转录因子对基因表达的激活/抑制关系。它是有向网络——箭头从调控者指向被调控基因。</p>\n<p>关键结构特征：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>层级结构</strong>：调控网络近似有向无环图（DAG），存在从&quot;主调控因子&quot;到&quot;末端效应基因&quot;的层级</li>\n<li><strong>网络基序过表达</strong>：前馈环（Feed-Forward Loop, FFL）在转录调控网络中出现频率远超随机基准——该基序实现了信号的时间过滤功能</li>\n<li><strong>入度/出度不对称</strong>：少数&quot;主转录因子&quot;有极高出度（调控大量基因），大多数基因出度低</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>基序类型</th>\n<th>拓扑</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>过表达于</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前馈环（FFL）</td>\n<td>X→Y, X→Z, Y→Z</td>\n<td>持续信号检测/脉冲生成</td>\n<td>转录调控网络</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反馈环</td>\n<td>X→Y→Z→X</td>\n<td>振荡/双稳态</td>\n<td>信号转导</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自调控</td>\n<td>X→X</td>\n<td>噪声缓冲</td>\n<td>广泛存在</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双扇出</td>\n<td>X→Y, X→Z</td>\n<td>协调调控</td>\n<td>全局调控因子</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"网络医学-从网络到疾病\">网络医学：从网络到疾病</h2><p>网络医学（Network Medicine）由 Barabasi 等人系统提出，核心假设是：疾病不是单基因/单蛋白的故障，而是交互网络中功能模块的扰动。</p>\n<p><strong>疾病模块假说</strong>：与同一疾病相关的基因倾向于在 PPI 网络中形成连通子图（疾病模块）。验证：已知的疾病基因在 interactome 中的平均距离显著小于随机期望。</p>\n<p><strong>网络邻近度药物重定位</strong>：2026 年 Barabasi 团队在 Nature Aging 发表的工作将网络邻近度方法应用于衰老研究——测量 6,442 种化合物到各衰老标志模块的网络距离，结合转录组指标 pAGE 筛选抗衰老药物重定位候选。</p>\n<p>网络邻近度的计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></munder><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d(S, T) = \\frac{1}{|T|} \\sum_{t \\in T} \\min_{s \\in S} d(s, t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6431em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7717em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 是药物靶点集合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 是疾病基因集合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d(s,t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是 interactome 中的最短路径。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d(S,T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 越小，药物作用于疾病模块越&quot;近&quot;——重定位潜力越大。</p>\n<h2 id=\"演化与网络-适应度景观\">演化与网络：适应度景观</h2><p>将基因型到表型的映射可视化为网络（适应度景观/中性网络），其中：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>节点 = 基因型（序列）</li>\n<li>边 = 单点突变连接</li>\n<li>节点值 = 适应度</li>\n</ul>\n<p>中性网络理论（Kimura/Wagner）：大量中性突变连成渗流网络中的巨分量——允许种群在不丧失功能的前提下在序列空间中扩散，为后续的适应性跃迁提供&quot;平台&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生物网络分析的特殊挑战\">生物网络分析的特殊挑战</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>噪声与不完整性</strong>：实验技术的假阳性率高（Y2H: ~50%），且大量交互尚未测量</li>\n<li><strong>条件依赖性</strong>：交互是动态的——许多边只在特定条件（组织、时间点、刺激）下存在</li>\n<li><strong>有向性与符号</strong>：调控网络的边有方向和符号（激活/抑制），静态 PPI 图通常无向</li>\n<li><strong>多尺度</strong>：分子网络→细胞网络→组织网络→生态网络的跨尺度整合仍是开放问题</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>生物网络从分子到生态尺度展示了网络科学工具的跨学科通用性。蛋白质交互网络的无标度和模块化性质解释了细胞的鲁棒性与脆弱性；代谢网络的蝴蝶结结构提供了灵活适应的架构模板；调控网络的基序分析揭示了自然选择&quot;收藏&quot;的信息处理元件。网络医学将这些结构知识转化为临床应用——2026 年 Barabasi 团队的衰老网络药理学工作展示了从 interactome 到药物重定位的完整管道。生物网络分析的核心挑战在于数据噪声高、交互条件依赖、且跨尺度整合仍是开放问题。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p>相关文档：<a href=\"social-network-analysis\">社会网络分析</a> | <a href=\"technological-networks\">技术网络</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"生物网络（Biological Networks）","id":"生物网络-biological-networks"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"生物学的网络视角","id":"生物学的网络视角"},{"level":2,"text":"蛋白质交互网络（Interactome）","id":"蛋白质交互网络-interactome"},{"level":2,"text":"代谢网络","id":"代谢网络"},{"level":2,"text":"基因调控网络","id":"基因调控网络"},{"level":2,"text":"网络医学：从网络到疾病","id":"网络医学-从网络到疾病"},{"level":2,"text":"演化与网络：适应度景观","id":"演化与网络-适应度景观"},{"level":2,"text":"生物网络分析的特殊挑战","id":"生物网络分析的特殊挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"社会网络分析（Social Network Analysis）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/network-science-complex-systems/applications/social-network-analysis"},"next":{"title":"技术网络（Technological Networks）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/network-science-complex-systems/applications/technological-networks"}}